Package: qualtricsmasker
Title: Mask Participant Identifiers in Qualtrics Exports
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Francesco", "Zanibellato", email = "fz150@georgetown.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Replaces participant identifiers in Qualtrics survey exports
    (Prolific, CloudResearch Connect and MTurk IDs, IP addresses, locations,
    emails) with random codes prefixed by "MSK", so that data can be shared
    without disclosing identities while repeated participants remain
    recognizable. Reads and writes CSV, SPSS (.sav) and Excel (.xlsx) exports.
